sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant CLI as eatme CLI
    participant AliceAPI as eatme-alice
    participant Alice as Alice desktop
    participant Runs as runs/ evidence
    participant Parser as A3P parser
    participant Grade as eatme-assets grading

    Student->>CLI: deps check
    CLI->>AliceAPI: check_dependencies(&RealCommandRunner)
    AliceAPI-->>CLI: DependencyReport
    Student->>CLI: alice launch-smoke --scenario ...
    CLI->>AliceAPI: discover_alice + package_alice + run_launch_smoke
    AliceAPI->>Alice: build and launch Alice
    Student->>Alice: place object, edit code, run, save
    Alice-->>Runs: screenshot, window list, ui_action_contract, saved project
    AliceAPI-->>CLI: LaunchSmokeManifest
    CLI->>Parser: load saved .a3p / program.xml
    Parser-->>Grade: Program AST
    Grade-->>CLI: GradingReport
    CLI-->>Student: evidence + grading result
